<title>BELGIUM: Gevaert ups stake in IVG.</title>
<headline>Gevaert ups stake in IVG.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian holding company Gevaert said in a statement on Wednesday it had increased its holding in Germany's IVG Holding AG to 10 from 7.5 percent.</p>
<p>Gevaert gave no financial details.</p>
<p>It is the second time in little over a month that Gevaert has raised its IVG holding stake. On December 6, Gevaert announced it owned 7.5 percent of IVG, up from an initial two percent interest bought at the beginning of 1996.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
